<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 365 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 365 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction July 15 versus July 8  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   182/189		363/340</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.16/3.14	    3.44/3.38</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.16/3.14	    3.45/3.38</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.15/3.13	    3.43/3.37</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   185/490		180/123</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    185/914		270/243</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,956 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
